    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yuuhngr",
      "content": "• Rigveda is the oldest Veda"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Rigveda is the oldest religious text in the world, containing 1,028 hymns divided into 10 Mandalas.",
        "The Gayatri Mantra is dedicated to Savitr and is found in the 3rd Mandala of the Rigveda.",
        "Sabha was an elite council of elders, while Samiti was the general assembly of common people.",
        "Iron was referred to as 'Shyama Ayas' or 'Krishna Ayas' in the Later Vedic texts."
      ],
      "id": "dxsy00c"
    },
